'''Walpurgisnacht''' (ワルプルギスの夜, ''Warupurugisu no Yoru'', '''Walpurgisnacht''') is a [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event|Puella Magi Madoka Magica]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 10.9 Update]]. It features the [[Walpurgisnacht (Enemy)|Walpurgisnacht]] enemy.

==Overview==
===About===
Walpurgisnacht contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Stagebuilding Witch: Cycle''' (舞台装置の魔女 周目). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first stage is the [[True Form]] of [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]] completion of other stages can include XP, [[Battle Items]] and [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event. Every Stagebuilding Witch: Cycle plays out the same, but the strength magnifications and enemy base's HP are increased with each level.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Walpurgisnacht (Gauntlet)/Stagebuilding Witch: Cycle 1~10|Walpurgisnacht/Stagebuilding Witch: Cycle 1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*Walpurgisnacht can be played three days in during the collaboration period.

